Subject: [PATCH 07/31] docs: close each phase with a patch and a state note

Standing convention, requested after phase 1.5: when a phase closes, produce
the format-patch for that phase and for the full history, plus a short note
covering what was built, what is still missing, which debt was accepted and
which decision is waiting on a person.

The working container is ephemeral. The patch is what outlives it.

